{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12358","headline":"春暮过石龟谷题温处士林园 · 钱起","name":"春暮过石龟谷题温处士林园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隐几无名老，何年此陆沈。\n丘园自得性，婚嫁不婴心。\n岁计因山薄，霞栖在谷深。\n设罝连草色，晒药背松阴。\n触兴云生岫，随耕鸟下林。\n搘颐笑来客，头上有朝簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}